<title>USA: Mobile America to pay out $0.40/shr div.</title>
<headline>Mobile America to pay out $0.40/shr div.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile America Corp said Thursday it would pay a $0.40 per share dividend January 27 on its $0.025 par value common stock to shareholders of record January 13.</p>
<p>The prior year dividend was $0.35 per share, the company said.</p>
</text>
